  "decisions": [
    "Original large tooltip order and conditional acid proof; no fabricated thermometer or standalone capacity row.",
    "Large thermal hull100U remains separate from controller construction REV4U; existing8 precise source compositions unchanged.",
    "Low-density rejection only fizzes; true vapor captures its material boiling point and amount before the thermal step.",
    "Gas damage uses material BP and source2/4 multipliers in original bounds; fire needs BP>=2000 and max(1,floor9amount/U) attempts.",
    "Explosive vapor clears contents and pending conversions; original stepped UT.Code.scale1..6/8 feeds existing modern world explosion boundary.",
    "Source fire targets y=-1..range and x/z=-range..range,2/3 neighbor-flammability checking; collision/carpet/GT-owned/protected-node guards.",
    "Large contact delegates uncapped original temperature damage on main and bound walls; generic mold/basin proximity burn unchanged.",
    "Source meltdown uses T/25 fire attempts and flowing lava metadata1; ordinary1 block, large all27 positions."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "Modern vanilla world explosion physics and immediate adapter execution differ from original ExplosionGT/post-tick implementation; strength inputs are source-aligned.",
    "Existing pipe-fire protected tag represents external protected nodes rather than hardcoded Thaumcraft INode support.",
    "Source death-to-material absorption, hot-break behavior and generic companion proximity hazards remain outside this batch.",
    "Cold targetSolidifying mapping, any other phase/reaction gaps and full natural heat/alloy chain are not declared complete."
  ]
